menu "LVGL bench"

config BENCH_TEXT_EVERY_FRAME
    bool "A line of text changes every frame"
    default n
    help
        The seconds line shows a number that counts up every frame, as a
        clock or a sensor reading does, instead of the seconds. The Cranpose
        demo's text-drawn and text-composed features show the same line.

config BENCH_DASHBOARD
    bool "The dashboard in place of the demo's screen"
    default n
    help
        The dashboard of crates/cranpose/tests/support/dashboard.rs, which
        changes most of the display every frame. The Cranpose demo's
        dashboard feature and the Slint benchmark show the same screen.

endmenu
